WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.230
It's the strongest Earthbound 
Immortal!  Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:15.010
By skipping the Battle Phase, the 
opponent’s life points become 1!

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.540
I’m at Maya Memorial Park.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.210
At 5:47pm, a mysterious 
light shaped like Nazca's

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:29.210
condor geoglyph appeared at 
Director Godwin’s mansion.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:33.770
It’s surrounded by blue flames, 
so we can’t get any closer.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:39.720
Is this connected to the fire that occurred 
a week ago at Domino City West 5th District?

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.220
The Public Maintenance Department 
hasn't announced anything yet.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:50.480
The legendary D-Wheeler learned that 
it's impossible to oppose destiny.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:55.770
That's because humans are 
mediocre and pathetic.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:01:00.080
In order to change destiny, you must 
surpass humanity and become a god!

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.070
Only then can miracles occur!

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:08.550
What?

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:09.430
What's this?

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:10.310
The mark…

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:11.350
Vanished.

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:20.990
What?  Godwin has all the marks!

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.530
I'm the ultimate god!

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.800
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.550
Godwin…

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:01.680
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:06.790
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:11.700
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:16.460
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.830
No matter how bad today is

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.810
There's still the faintest light

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.210
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:36.280
Is light it myself

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:41.290
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:46.260
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:52.560
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:56.540
Today will never exist again

00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:02.440
So I won't stop or vanish

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:31.770
The Strongest Earthbound Immortal!
Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:45.250
The bond between humans is weak.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:51.770
The only way to control destiny is to 
become a god and create a new world!

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:59.110
I can’t believe he's our enemy!

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.740
Yusei…

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:06.260
Damn, Godwin…

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.840
I don’t care about god!

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:13.550
And I don’t care about bonds either!

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:15.730
I'll surpass them all!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.700
Destiny doesn't affect me!

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:20.540
I’m driving at high speed, 
so you'll never catch me!

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:21.930
My turn!

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.140
I set one card!

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:30.140
I summon Magic Hole Golem 
in defense position!

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:36.440
I activate Magic Hole Golem’s effect!

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:43.930
Once a turn, I can halve the attack points 
of a monster on my field to attack you directly!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.530
I choose Mad Archfiend!

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:56.080
Mad Archfiend attacks you directly, Godwin!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.780
Bone Splash!

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.950
Stop joking, Jack.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:11.150
No matter how fast you go, 
you can’t break our bond!

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:14.360
I flip over my trap card Shadow Dance!

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:20.870
When a monster successfully attacks you 
directly, you take 1000 points of damage!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:21.790
What?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.630
That’s right!

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.310
It doesn’t matter whether 
you’re a Signer or not!

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:31.510
We already have a bond called friendship!

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.650
It’s a mark that will never vanish!

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:36.550
With our bond, we will defeat destiny!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.950
I flip over my card!  Rising Rush!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:47.930
When you take damage from an effect, I can 
Special Summon one Tuner Monster from my hand!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:50.430
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.990
All right!  It’s your turn, Yusei!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.600
My turn!

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.740
Level 3 Junk Synchron 
tunes Level 4 Max Warrior!

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:14.720
The roars come together to form an 
echoing arrow that pierces the sky!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.490
Become the path that lights the way!

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.470
Synchro Summon!

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:20.460
Come, Junk Archer!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.610
I activate Junk Archer’s effect!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:29.800
Once a turn, I can remove your monster 
from play until the End Phase!

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:33.460
Junk Archer, remove Moon Dragon Quilla!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.220
Dimension Shoot!

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:43.450
Now all our cards are linked!

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:45.450
This is our bond!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.430
His field is wide open!

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:50.510
Junk Archer attacks Godwin directly!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.020
Scrap Arrow!

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.830
I won’t let you do that!  
I activate a trap card!

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.060
Offering to the Immortals!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:07:05.180
If your monster declares an attack when I have 
no monsters on my field, that attack is negated.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:11.000
Afterwards, I Special Summon 
two Ceremonial Tokens.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:23.690
Then I can add one card with "Earthbound 
Immortal" in its name from my deck to my hand!

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:24.950
What?

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:28.130
Not only did he negate 
the attack and summon two

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:31.630
Tokens, but he also added an 
Earthbound Immortal to his hand.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.950
That's dirty!

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:40.900
It's only natural.  I’m the 
ultimate god who has everything!

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:45.810
Earthbound Immortal is 
coming on the next turn!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.930
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:55.850
Moon Dragon Quilla returns to 
the field during the End Phase.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.100
Yusei…

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.080
My turn!

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:07.930
I release two Ceremonial Tokens!

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.940
I’m bringing ultimate destruction!

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:16.530
The strongest Earthbound Immortal!  
Come, Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.510
What’s that light?

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:31.450
Oh no!  People are turning into light and-

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.860
Run away!

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:46.170
It's absorbing souls!

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.640
Earthbound Immortal!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.720
Outta my way!

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:38.230
We're nearing the climax of the ritual.

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:42.920
The king of the underworld is excited 
by Earthbound Immortal's arrival.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:49.920
After waking from its deep sleep, it yearns to 
drink your blood to quench its 5000-year thirst!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:53.760
Godwin!

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:11.380
The Signers’ dragons can use 
their power on this field!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.820
We won’t let you interfere!

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:14.760
Eternal Sunshine!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.530
Black Rose Flare!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:22.780
Aki!  Ruka!

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:26.540
It's the first time I've had 
friends, and I'll fight for them!

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.380
Yeah!  In order to protect our bond!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.090
Hooray!  Hooray!  Yusei!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:35.040
Master Atlas, do your best!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:37.030
Don’t lose, Crow!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.350
Their hopes...

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.710
...are with us!

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.340
Everything you do is a joke.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:08.010
Godwin, our hopes and our 
bond will overcome destiny!

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:12.020
You're so naive.  Destiny will devour you.

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:17.940
The eternal battle between the Crimson Dragon 
and the evil god will control and silence you.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:23.460
That’s why I’m going to become 
a god and create a better world!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.290
Godwin!

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:28.230
I’ll show you despair, Yusei Fudo.

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:32.170
With Wiraqocha Rasca’s 
effect, once a turn, I can

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:36.170
drop you to 1 life point by 
skipping the Battle Phase!

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.070
Yusei will only have 1 life point?

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:41.770
That’s crazy!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.350
How’s that?

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.650
You'll feel hopeless!

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:47.620
Powerless!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:48.820
Helpless!

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:52.760
Sorry, but we never feel that way 
because we grew up in Satellite!

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:53.960
Crow!

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:58.830
No matter how tough life gets, we still 
cut through the wind and keep going ahead!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.970
The legendary D-Wheeler taught us that!

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.140
But he couldn’t accomplish anything.

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.410
You’re wrong!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:10.600
Even though he knew it was impossible, 
he tried to change the status quo.

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:14.730
That memory strikes a chord in our hearts!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:21.640
Godwin, no matter what you think, I embody 
that spirit!  As does Yusei and Jack!

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.570
As does everyone in Satellite!

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:26.720
I’ll never feel helpless!

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.600
Crow...

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:32.100
Crow!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:39.280
Emotions alone aren't enough to reach me.

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.290
I’ll break your bond!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.530
I activate Wiraqocha Rasca's effect!

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.980
My emotions will reach you!

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.680
I flip over my trap card!

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.150
Life Exchange!

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:55.510
If a card effect changes life points, 
I become the target of that effect!

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:56.750
Don't do it, Crow!

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:00.200
I won’t let you hurt Yusei!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:03.690
He’s the one who created 
our bond of friendship!

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:07.280
Yusei strengthened our bond!

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:13.800
That’s why no matter how badly I'm hurt, our 
bond will never break as long as Yusei is around!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.040
Crow…

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.270
You…

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:19.940
I’ll do as you wish.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.980
Do it, Wiraqocha Rasca!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.980
Turn Crow’s life points into 1!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.050
Polar Star Obey!

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:27.680
Crow!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:28.550
Crow!

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:38.230
Godwin, Crow the Bullet 
will continue the legend!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.620
Life Exchange has another effect.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.800
When my life points decrease, 
your monster is destroyed!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.100
What?

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.630
I wanted to get rid of Earthbound Immortal,

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:51.130
but I'll settle for destroying 
Moon Dragon Quilla!

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:03.340
Crow!

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:09.960
When Moon Dragon Quilla is destroyed, Sun 
Dragon Inti resurrects from my graveyard.

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:12.900
No way!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.530
I’m not done!

00:14:16.530 --> 00:14:22.040
I release Armor Master to activate the 
Continuous Trap Blackwing - Bombardment!

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:27.260
I pass the the legendary D-Wheeler's 
baton to Jack and Yusei!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:31.510
These emotions will lead to the 
completion of the Daedalus Bridge!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.450
Yusei!  Jack!  I’m counting on you!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.810
Crow!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.070
Crow!

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.290
Crow!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.260
No way…

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:45.960
Crow!

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.390
Crow!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.430
Crow!

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:58.640
A D-Wheeler who can’t drive 
doesn't get to play on his turn.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:01.120
No one cares about the legendary D-Wheeler.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.990
No one cares about your bond.

00:15:02.990 --> 00:15:06.130
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:16.530
Our bond isn’t broken yet.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.160
Crow!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.160
Godwin, you punk!

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.170
My turn!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.350
I summon Sinister Sprocket!

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:36.350
Level 1 Sinister Sprocket tunes Level 4 Mad 
Archfiend and Level 3 Magic Hole Golem!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:41.130
The pulse of the King now forms a line here!

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.450
Witness the power of the rumbling heavens!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.360
Synchro Summon!

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.990
My soul!  Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:57.510
But if Sun Dragon Inti is 
destroyed, your monster is

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:01.510
destroyed, and you take damage 
equal to its attack points.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.230
I flip over my trap card!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.670
Half Straight!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:10.150
I halve Red Dragon Archfiend's attack 
points until my next Standby Phase.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.590
If it has less attack points 
than your monster with

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:17.090
the highest attack points, 
it can attack you directly!

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:23.650
Sun Dragon Inti can't lead it astray, 
so it will bite your throat!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.380
Go, Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.930
Absolute Powerforce!

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.740
Sun Dragon Inti’s effect activates!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:34.000
Its own attack points become 0!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:34.940
What?

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:38.480
Half Straight’s effect now doesn’t work.

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.540
That means it can only battle...

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.680
That’s right.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.010
You can’t attack Earthbound Immortal.

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:47.200
Therefore, you'll have to 
battle Sun Dragon Inti.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:51.190
That means Red Dragon 
Archfiend will be destroyed!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.960
I flip over my Continuous Trap!

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.660
Scrubbed Raid!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:59.500
By sending a card on the field to the 
graveyard, the Battle Phase ends!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:02.270
Jack!  Use this card!

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.670
Jack Atlas.

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.080
What are you fighting for?

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.630
It’s not to see destiny to the end.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.580
It’s not to resist the gods.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:15.590
You don’t even care about bonds.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.560
Jack!  Don’t let him trick you!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.300
Use Scrubbed Raid's effect!

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:25.220
In order to get the title of the King, 
you abandoned your Satellite friends.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:32.300
Didn’t you abandon the 
bond of friendship before?

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:35.630
Unless you're a loner, you 
can’t become the King.

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.740
You knew that.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.890
You’re wrong!  We're Jack's friends!

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.430
He’s not alone!

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:43.970
I was also a loner.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.470
I had to face destiny alone.

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:52.410
That's why I knew that my only 
path was to become a god.

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:55.120
Jack, it’s the same with you.

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:59.990
By abandoning everything and becoming a 
loner, you chose the path of the King!

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:02.830
Your fight is to become the King!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.880
All this talk about bonds makes me laugh.

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:10.300
Yusei Fudo, people are loners by nature!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:14.300
If you rely on others, you become 
spoiled and irresponsible!

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:17.410
That bond can't defeat destiny!

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:21.410
You’re right.  I was a loner.

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:22.610
Jack!

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:27.250
Red Dragon Archfiend attacks Sun Dragon Inti!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.120
Absolute Powerforce!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:41.660
Jack, you're the King of loners!

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.690
You'll feel the same pain that I felt.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:48.370
I activate Sun Dragon Inti’s effect!

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:52.050
The monster that destroyed Inti is also

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:56.050
destroyed, and you take damage 
equal to its attack points!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.350
Jack, why?

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:05.960
When Sun Dragon Inti is destroyed, Moon 
Dragon Quilla resurrects from my graveyard.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:09.990
I set one card and end my turn.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:15.210
Jack, you have no friends 
and don’t rely on bonds.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.650
That lonely spirit befits a King.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.910
But being a King isn’t good enough.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.360
You must become a god.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:26.330
I, the god, will create the world!

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:30.950
Never forget that I’m no longer the King!

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:36.990
It’s true that I threw 
away my bonds and friends.

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:40.560
And I also threw away my status as the King.

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:42.030
Jack…

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:47.010
But after I threw everything 
away, I gained one small thing.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:50.440
And that’s why I’m here!

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:56.190
Godwin!  Too bad, but I’m not alone!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:20:00.210
Even though I never wanted to join 
them, I'm now part of this rowdy group!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:06.770
Jack…

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:12.410
No matter how hard I try to deny 
it, I can't escape from this bond.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:15.130
I learned that…

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.530
…from the love of a woman!

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:23.130
Godwin, it's hard to become all alone!

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.580
People are all the same!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:28.010
In the end, everyone becomes satisfied 
with such simplistic ideas!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:32.040
That’s why I had to be the 
one to reach these heights!

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:33.770
That’s not true!

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:36.760
We’ll prove that with our bond!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:38.050
My turn!

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:43.090
I’ll attack him directly with Junk Archer!

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:47.390
Due to Junk Archer’s effect, Moon 
Dragon Quilla is removed from play!

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:49.330
Dimension Shoot!

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:52.310
I won’t let you do that!  I 
flip over my Continuous Trap!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:53.760
Destruct Potion!

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:58.740
By destroying my own monster, I gain 
life points equal to its attack points.

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:00.940
I destroy Moon Dragon Quilla.

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:04.410
When the moon sets, the sun rises again.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:07.640
Resurrect, Sun Dragon Inti!

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:12.110
Junk Archer’s effect can 
only be used once per turn.

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.580
Now there’s nothing you can do.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.590
I end my turn.

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:21.900
Friends, bonds, legend, love…

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:23.220
Did they do anything?

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:27.060
Were you able to hurt destiny even a little?

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:30.740
Destiny laughs at us and cannot be changed!

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:35.460
But I will travel the only remaining 
path!  The path of thorns!

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:38.990
The path to becoming a god!  Leave it to me!

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:44.410
Worship me!  I will create the new world!

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:02.280
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:07.350
We will build our own future

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:12.790
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:17.960
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:33.100
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.530 --> 00:22:38.670
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.740 --> 00:22:43.380
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.850 --> 00:22:48.650
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:53.120
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:58.700
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:03.580
This journey has no end

00:23:03.800 --> 00:23:09.040
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.470 --> 00:23:14.280
Hear my voice
